          %p
            There is also another definition of the existential quantifier of a family of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mere+propositions"} mere propositions
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
